1
00:00:00,490 --> 00:00:04,630
I see. That legend...

2
00:00:05,810 --> 00:00:07,550
It was about us.

3
00:00:12,320 --> 00:00:14,320
Do you remember now?

4
00:00:15,240 --> 00:00:19,450
So Sooha's been connected 
to us since long ago.

5
00:00:20,100 --> 00:00:20,940
Yes.

6
00:00:21,330 --> 00:00:25,120
That's why we've been 
drawn to her since we met.

7
00:00:25,120 --> 00:00:29,880
And Marge was protecting us from Dardan.

8
00:00:30,110 --> 00:00:33,130
Jakah, can you detect Sooha's energy?

9
00:00:33,560 --> 00:00:36,190
Actually, I can't.

10
00:00:37,480 --> 00:00:40,700
There are only two reasons someone's 
energy would weaken this much.

11
00:00:41,110 --> 00:00:46,330
They're either unconscious 
or... no longer living.

12
00:00:46,980 --> 00:00:49,160
What was I doing?

13
00:00:49,580 --> 00:00:52,530
I was supposed to protect Sooha.

14
00:00:52,900 --> 00:00:54,900
Let's go to Vanfield House.

15
00:00:57,910 --> 00:01:01,910
Dardan may come for an object there.

16
00:01:02,390 --> 00:01:03,290
What object?

17
00:01:03,800 --> 00:01:08,040
Vionys, a scroll on the Vargr Kingdom.

18
00:01:08,500 --> 00:01:09,720
Vionys...

19
00:01:10,180 --> 00:01:16,050
The kingdom fell long ago, 
and only a few were told its secrets.

20
00:01:16,430 --> 00:01:21,310
Dardan needs those secrets 
to acquire power.

21
00:01:31,820 --> 00:01:35,070
I never thought I'd see you again.

22
00:01:35,830 --> 00:01:38,530
The princess must've brought us together.

23
00:01:39,780 --> 00:01:41,760
I know Sooha is alive.

24
00:01:41,760 --> 00:01:44,500
We'll find and rescue her no matter what.

25
00:03:11,060 --> 00:03:16,960
- Dark Moon: The Blood Altar -

26
00:03:18,960 --> 00:03:21,970
- The Black Mist of Railgun -

27
00:03:30,600 --> 00:03:34,480
It feels so strange to 
return to this place.

28
00:03:34,480 --> 00:03:37,240
Yeah. Voluntarily, too.

29
00:03:56,610 --> 00:03:58,500
Vionys is gone!

30
00:03:58,830 --> 00:04:00,210
We're too late.

31
00:04:00,210 --> 00:04:03,510
No, he could still be inside the mansion.

32
00:04:03,790 --> 00:04:04,840
Let's split up.

33
00:04:05,150 --> 00:04:06,770
I'll search the bedrooms.

34
00:04:06,770 --> 00:04:08,330
I'll check the third floor.

35
00:04:24,380 --> 00:04:26,660
<i>Guys, come to the lounge!</i>

36
00:04:30,930 --> 00:04:31,900
Jakah!

37
00:04:32,770 --> 00:04:34,500
This was the only one still here.

38
00:04:34,500 --> 00:04:36,330
Jaan caught him.

39
00:04:36,930 --> 00:04:37,460
What's wrong?

40
00:04:38,340 --> 00:04:41,630
I don't sense Marge inside the mansion.

41
00:04:47,730 --> 00:04:48,630
Don't tell me...

42
00:04:49,010 --> 00:04:51,070
Where did you take Marge?!

43
00:04:51,850 --> 00:04:53,630
Did Dardan put you up to this?

44
00:04:53,630 --> 00:04:55,160
Where did your allies go?!

45
00:04:56,690 --> 00:04:58,190
I'll try asking him.

46
00:04:59,650 --> 00:05:03,240
Where did you take Sooha and Marge?

47
00:05:07,920 --> 00:05:10,700
Where did you take the scroll you stole?

48
00:05:12,530 --> 00:05:13,820
Answer me!

49
00:05:16,360 --> 00:05:18,620
Printanier...

50
00:05:18,620 --> 00:05:20,130
Printanier?

51
00:05:20,130 --> 00:05:22,380
That's pretty far from here.

52
00:05:22,380 --> 00:05:24,800
What's in Printanier?

53
00:05:24,800 --> 00:05:26,900
Is Dardan there, too?

54
00:05:50,630 --> 00:05:54,340
Fool. I should've killed him right away.

55
00:05:55,000 --> 00:05:57,830
No matter. I'll figure it out.

56
00:06:00,630 --> 00:06:04,090
This time, we will become one.

57
00:06:06,190 --> 00:06:11,600
Those with shaman's blood have 
ruled this kingdom for generations.

58
00:06:11,600 --> 00:06:14,630
When a ruler left the throne,

59
00:06:14,630 --> 00:06:18,500
they sealed all their power 
inside the moon altar,

60
00:06:18,500 --> 00:06:19,880
and on the night of a full moon,

61
00:06:19,880 --> 00:06:24,060
the next ruler inherited 
their power through a ritual.

62
00:06:26,200 --> 00:06:31,620
When the moon is full, that altar's 
seal will be broken thanks to you.

63
00:06:32,150 --> 00:06:37,690
Then I will inherit that power 
and become the new king.

64
00:06:39,290 --> 00:06:43,460
The last thing I need is Vargr's blood.

65
00:06:45,080 --> 00:06:49,390
This time, everything will be mine.

66
00:06:56,680 --> 00:07:02,690
<i>Despite my family's downfall, I rose 
to become chancellor of this kingdom.</i>

67
00:07:05,230 --> 00:07:08,860
<i>So what could I possibly be lacking?</i>

68
00:07:14,910 --> 00:07:19,380
<i>Beautiful Selen, I will make you mine!</i>

69
00:07:38,060 --> 00:07:39,600
The blood of Vargr!

70
00:07:42,490 --> 00:07:45,250
Dardan! What are you doing there?

71
00:07:46,930 --> 00:07:48,500
Get away from Vionys!

72
00:07:51,890 --> 00:07:55,450
Only royals are permitted to read this!

73
00:07:55,450 --> 00:07:59,870
Status, status, status! This again?

74
00:08:00,220 --> 00:08:01,620
Well, I've had enough!

75
00:08:01,620 --> 00:08:04,340
What are you plotting?

76
00:08:04,340 --> 00:08:07,290
I simply desire power!

77
00:08:07,290 --> 00:08:09,500
So you read the forbidden scroll?

78
00:08:09,880 --> 00:08:11,920
You will pay for this!

79
00:08:17,460 --> 00:08:21,980
The scroll was only forbidden so 
the royals could hog all the power!

80
00:08:23,020 --> 00:08:25,100
Someone help! Help!

81
00:08:30,650 --> 00:08:32,260
The blood of Vargr...

82
00:08:34,710 --> 00:08:37,150
Selen, you're awake!

83
00:08:38,110 --> 00:08:38,990
Thank goodness.

84
00:08:39,560 --> 00:08:41,030
You're all right now.

85
00:08:41,030 --> 00:08:45,720
Mother, I met the god Vargr.

86
00:08:46,470 --> 00:08:50,000
O great Vargr, thank you.

87
00:08:52,920 --> 00:08:56,710
Why? No matter how much blood 
I drink, I'm still thirsty.

88
00:08:57,090 --> 00:09:00,250
And the slightest bit of 
exposure to the sun...

89
00:09:00,760 --> 00:09:04,020
I drank Vargr's blood, 
just like the princess.

90
00:09:04,020 --> 00:09:07,980
Did I not drink enough? Is it 
because I lack shamanistic powers?

91
00:09:08,310 --> 00:09:12,530
If only I'd managed to read all of Vionys!

92
00:09:12,930 --> 00:09:17,790
Why can't I become a perfect vampire?!

93
00:09:20,130 --> 00:09:23,790
This time, for certain...

94
00:09:33,810 --> 00:09:37,330
How come I'm stuck 
carrying everyone's crap?

95
00:09:37,330 --> 00:09:39,260
'Cause you suck at rock-paper-scissors.

96
00:09:41,730 --> 00:09:42,500
Hey.

97
00:09:44,590 --> 00:09:45,430
What?

98
00:09:49,390 --> 00:09:50,340
Mahan!

99
00:09:54,300 --> 00:09:57,130
What happened? Where are Kamil and Ruslan?

100
00:09:57,710 --> 00:09:58,820
They were caught.

101
00:10:01,130 --> 00:10:04,780
There's a bar called 
the Railgun in Printanier.

102
00:10:05,190 --> 00:10:08,470
We snuck in because we heard it 
was frequented by vampires.

103
00:10:09,000 --> 00:10:12,360
But it was a whole den of them.

104
00:10:13,210 --> 00:10:15,610
Just when we thought we'd defeated them,

105
00:10:16,230 --> 00:10:18,190
<i>he</i> showed up.

106
00:10:24,020 --> 00:10:27,600
When I woke up, I was in some storeroom.

107
00:10:31,410 --> 00:10:33,370
Kamil! Ruslan!

108
00:10:37,990 --> 00:10:42,050
A bunch of werewolves were trapped there.

109
00:10:43,340 --> 00:10:44,790
But why?

110
00:10:45,190 --> 00:10:47,540
I don't know exactly.

111
00:10:47,990 --> 00:10:52,960
I managed to escape, 
but I lost Kamil and Ruslan.

112
00:10:53,620 --> 00:10:55,220
It's not your fault.

113
00:10:55,610 --> 00:10:57,090
We're glad you made it back.

114
00:10:57,330 --> 00:11:00,590
Mahan, can you take us to that storeroom?

115
00:11:00,920 --> 00:11:02,090
Probably.

116
00:11:02,090 --> 00:11:03,880
Let's head out right away.

117
00:11:03,880 --> 00:11:06,140
We're going to rescue Kamil and Ruslan.

118
00:11:16,540 --> 00:11:17,570
Sooha!

119
00:11:18,330 --> 00:11:19,230
Heli.

120
00:11:26,830 --> 00:11:27,800
Sooha!

121
00:11:30,220 --> 00:11:32,330
Sooha! Are you okay?!

122
00:11:33,810 --> 00:11:36,590
<i>The moon altar...</i>

123
00:11:36,860 --> 00:11:37,840
Huh?

124
00:11:39,570 --> 00:11:43,110
<i>Take the sword to the moon altar...</i>

125
00:11:43,730 --> 00:11:44,810
The sword?

126
00:11:47,850 --> 00:11:51,350
Sooha!

127
00:11:53,890 --> 00:11:56,230
I just saw Sooha in a dream.

128
00:11:57,100 --> 00:11:58,110
Me, too.

129
00:11:58,150 --> 00:11:59,360
I saw her, too.

130
00:11:59,810 --> 00:12:01,860
She was in a strange place.

131
00:12:01,860 --> 00:12:05,070
Like a dark cave.

132
00:12:05,410 --> 00:12:07,220
She was lying down.

133
00:12:08,950 --> 00:12:12,080
Sooha mentioned a sword, didn't she?

134
00:12:12,910 --> 00:12:16,310
"Take the sword to the moon altar..."

135
00:12:17,020 --> 00:12:20,980
- Dark Moon: The Blood Altar -

136
00:12:21,030 --> 00:12:24,970
- Dark Moon: The Blood Altar -

137
00:12:38,140 --> 00:12:39,360
This is it.

138
00:12:39,750 --> 00:12:42,230
Jakah, can you sense Sooha's energy?

139
00:12:42,570 --> 00:12:45,280
No. No trace of Marge's 
or Dardan's, either.

140
00:12:45,600 --> 00:12:48,780
Is Vionys really here?

141
00:12:48,780 --> 00:12:53,370
There must be a reason 
he had those matches.

142
00:12:53,370 --> 00:12:55,420
Be careful, guys.

143
00:12:55,420 --> 00:12:57,170
There's something nearby.

144
00:12:57,660 --> 00:13:01,460
I sense a massive amount 
of energy coming from it.

145
00:13:01,460 --> 00:13:04,320
It's far beyond anything
we've encountered so far.

146
00:13:12,680 --> 00:13:15,180
Seriously? There's no one here.

147
00:13:15,560 --> 00:13:17,310
Are they not open?

148
00:13:17,650 --> 00:13:19,770
The door was unlocked, though.

149
00:13:21,350 --> 00:13:22,230
That way.

150
00:13:23,090 --> 00:13:25,360
That's where his energy's coming from.

151
00:13:36,620 --> 00:13:38,260
A storeroom?

152
00:13:43,420 --> 00:13:45,630
I can't see a thing.

153
00:13:45,630 --> 00:13:48,640
It's like the room is full of mist.

154
00:13:53,980 --> 00:13:55,270
We're trapped!

155
00:13:55,270 --> 00:13:55,810
What?

156
00:13:55,810 --> 00:13:57,560
I'll give it a shot.

157
00:14:00,130 --> 00:14:02,320
If the door won't open, 
I'll break it down.

158
00:14:04,070 --> 00:14:04,910
Huh?

159
00:14:06,020 --> 00:14:08,630
I feel weak...

160
00:14:11,230 --> 00:14:13,870
Something's off. I can't breathe...

161
00:14:20,300 --> 00:14:21,830
I've been waiting for you.

162
00:14:23,430 --> 00:14:26,880
I knew you'd come.

163
00:14:27,170 --> 00:14:29,890
Who is he?

164
00:14:30,250 --> 00:14:34,420
This mist isn't just for 
putting you to sleep.

165
00:14:34,910 --> 00:14:38,020
It'll rob you of your strength, as well.

166
00:14:38,290 --> 00:14:39,770
Guys, get outside!

167
00:14:42,350 --> 00:14:42,980
It's open!

168
00:15:01,450 --> 00:15:06,920
Once the moon is full, you will 
acquire all your power on this altar.

169
00:15:08,580 --> 00:15:12,030
Of course, it will all become mine.

170
00:15:15,740 --> 00:15:21,270
Back then, you had the power, 
and I had my love.

171
00:15:21,270 --> 00:15:23,020
I hope it's the reverse this time.

172
00:15:23,500 --> 00:15:27,400
I'll have the power, 
and you'll have love for me.

173
00:15:35,140 --> 00:15:36,970
Jaan, run!

174
00:15:41,250 --> 00:15:42,750
<i>I feel weak...</i>

175
00:15:50,360 --> 00:15:52,740
Damn. I can't even transform.

176
00:15:53,400 --> 00:15:56,020
We have to defeat the guy 
controlling the mist.

177
00:15:56,340 --> 00:15:58,080
Jakah, where is he?!

178
00:16:06,930 --> 00:16:10,050
You're completely powerless now!

179
00:16:17,010 --> 00:16:17,850
<i>Heli.</i>

180
00:16:18,920 --> 00:16:19,970
<i>Solon.</i>

181
00:16:21,340 --> 00:16:22,470
<i>Shion.</i>

182
00:16:23,460 --> 00:16:24,500
<i>Jino.</i>

183
00:16:25,790 --> 00:16:26,760
<i>Jaan.</i>

184
00:16:27,960 --> 00:16:28,920
<i>Jakah.</i>

185
00:16:29,990 --> 00:16:30,920
<i>Noa.</i>

186
00:16:34,350 --> 00:16:35,560
<i>Remember.</i>

187
00:16:40,370 --> 00:16:43,640
And now, you are vampire lords.

188
00:17:30,690 --> 00:17:34,360
How? How did they regain their power?!

189
00:17:34,360 --> 00:17:36,610
Damn it! In that case...

190
00:17:39,850 --> 00:17:41,260
The mist got thicker!

191
00:17:43,540 --> 00:17:46,140
How's that? Now you can't even move.

192
00:17:48,510 --> 00:17:49,520
Gotcha!

193
00:17:49,520 --> 00:17:51,160
We're over here!

194
00:18:12,850 --> 00:18:14,570
The mist is receding.

195
00:18:17,700 --> 00:18:20,370
What? They all collapsed at once.

196
00:18:20,670 --> 00:18:22,370
Is it because we killed him?

197
00:18:23,030 --> 00:18:27,370
He made those vampires by biting 
them, so their deaths were linked.

198
00:18:27,710 --> 00:18:28,920
Is everyone okay?

199
00:18:28,920 --> 00:18:29,880
Yeah.

200
00:18:30,590 --> 00:18:34,630
This thing appeared on my hand, 
and I regained consciousness.

201
00:18:34,930 --> 00:18:38,510
In fact, my body feels lighter than ever.

202
00:18:38,850 --> 00:18:41,390
I feel stronger, too.

203
00:18:41,640 --> 00:18:45,140
The moment this appeared, I became a wolf.

204
00:18:45,420 --> 00:18:49,520
I think Sooha is helping us.

205
00:18:52,330 --> 00:18:53,020
Who's there?

206
00:18:54,350 --> 00:18:55,980
It's still alive.

207
00:18:56,300 --> 00:18:58,190
Where did your allies go?

208
00:19:00,620 --> 00:19:03,450
The royal palace...

209
00:19:09,780 --> 00:19:11,860
Did he mean the ancient palace?

210
00:19:12,300 --> 00:19:14,350
But that was a thousand years ago.

211
00:19:14,910 --> 00:19:19,260
This is roughly where 
the palace used to be.

212
00:19:21,340 --> 00:19:23,010
Automnal, huh?

213
00:19:23,570 --> 00:19:26,430
City hall was built on 
top of the palace ruins.

214
00:19:33,580 --> 00:19:34,330
The sword.

215
00:19:36,610 --> 00:19:40,840
The last time I wielded that sword was 
when I fought Dardan in the palace.

216
00:19:42,440 --> 00:19:43,670
Maybe...

217
00:19:51,080 --> 00:19:53,710
Our kin were being held in here.

218
00:19:54,300 --> 00:19:55,610
There's no one here.

219
00:19:55,610 --> 00:19:57,710
Was this really the place?

220
00:19:58,790 --> 00:20:01,730
They were all taken away.

221
00:20:05,480 --> 00:20:10,530
This place is merely where 
the vampires keep us imprisoned.

222
00:20:10,900 --> 00:20:16,650
They're ultimately put on boats 
and sent to a city called Automnal.

223
00:20:17,170 --> 00:20:18,150
Who are you?

224
00:20:18,150 --> 00:20:19,930
A leftover.

225
00:20:19,930 --> 00:20:22,200
Apparently, they have 
no use for the elderly.

226
00:20:23,870 --> 00:20:26,950
What happens to the ones 
who get sent to the city?

227
00:20:27,180 --> 00:20:28,600
I don't know.

228
00:20:28,600 --> 00:20:34,580
What I do know is that they're 
looking for a special wolf.

229
00:20:35,170 --> 00:20:36,840
A special wolf?

230
00:20:39,750 --> 00:20:46,050
Dardan, the First Vampire, 
wants our kind's power.

231
00:20:46,050 --> 00:20:52,100
He needs that wolf's power to control us.

232
00:20:56,710 --> 00:20:58,910
They just keep coming.

233
00:21:00,020 --> 00:21:03,290
He's no ordinary vampire!

234
00:21:03,290 --> 00:21:05,280
Let's hit him with everything we've got!

235
00:21:07,370 --> 00:21:08,870
Him!

236
00:21:09,260 --> 00:21:10,870
That jerk...

237
00:21:16,120 --> 00:21:19,870
You. Where did you get that necklace?

238
00:21:19,870 --> 00:21:20,550
Huh?

239
00:21:21,000 --> 00:21:23,590
It's been passed down in 
my family for generations.

240
00:21:24,520 --> 00:21:28,760
This is undoubtedly the 
mark of the Lycanthrope.

241
00:21:29,110 --> 00:21:31,510
Lycanthrope?

242
00:21:34,700 --> 00:21:35,690
Could it be...

243
00:21:36,140 --> 00:21:39,440
Hold on. I have no idea what you mean.

244
00:21:39,770 --> 00:21:44,840
Lycanthropes are those who 
carry the blood of Vargr,

245
00:21:44,840 --> 00:21:47,270
the wolf god of the ancient Vargr Kingdom.

246
00:21:47,880 --> 00:21:51,450
You are a werewolf chosen by a god.

247
00:23:33,050 --> 00:23:39,930
<i>Next time, Episode 10: 
"Waning Moon: Mortal Combat in Automnal."</i>

248
00:23:36,990 --> 00:23:40,250
- Mortal Combat in Automnal -

